WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.740
Funabashi, you better not let go.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:04.830
Yes, yes.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.280
Good morning.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.900
Good morning

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.530
G-Good, got it.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.110
I'll see you around noon, then.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:18.950
Yes, we'll be waiting for you.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.870
Good morning, Gin.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.120
Saeki?

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.020
What are you doing?

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.790
Nothing.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:34.080
I'm digging the whole "early to 
bed and early to rise" thing!

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.560
I feel so good!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.780
Except you were the 
last one to wake up.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.430
Good morning!

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:41.930
Oh, Etsuko-san.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.580
Good morning.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.710
I see you're working hard.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.440
Oh, Sis? You're here already?

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.480
It's eight.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.940
Why are you already changed, then?

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:56.910
Oh, I wanted to hit the 
ground running today.

00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:00.860
Dad just wants to show off because 
so many people are here.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.640
Hey, Takami-kun....

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.890
I can't do this...

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.620
This is when I usually go to bed...

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.580
I'm about to keel over.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.590
Why don't you take a nap?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.660
No, I'm staying awake!

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:13.220
I won't let you win!

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.010
I mean, we've got all 
these teenage girls here.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:28.480
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:48.980
<b>Summer Cleansing</b>

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.950
Oh, you girls look nice.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:58.470
How about I take you all out on a date?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.030
You all look wonderful.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.960
Oh, right. There's a boy here.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.080
A friend of Satoru-kun's 
with blond hair.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.360
Blond hair?

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.650
Isn't that Shohei-kun?

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:13.580
Huh?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.180
He's already here?

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.460
I told him we weren't 
starting until noon.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.890
He almost looks like a foreigner.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.640
A foreigner?

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.650
Ah-ha...

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:31.180
Will this really cleanse my soul?

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:37.900
Well, Japanese people have always 
enjoyed traditional events.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:39.530
Who is this guy?

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:44.780
So, since my soul is already 
clean, what do I do?

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:46.550
You can leave...

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.670
Huh? It's not Shohei...

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.960
Oh, it's Kirishima-senpai?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.790
Hiwako!

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.820
What? The student council president?

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:58.560
Hello.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.800
Senpai, why are you here?

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:04.150
I came to enjoy this summer 
cleansing with you.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.820
But the ceremony doesn't 
begin until three.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.420
Oh, really?

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.280
It doesn't start for 
another five hours?

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.420
I guess I was too excited.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.480
Funabashi, you should have 
told us he was coming.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:20.440
But I didn't invite him...

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:25.070
Still, it worked out in the 
end since I get to see

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.250
Hiwako dressed up as a shrine maiden,

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:30.330
and I'm being welcomed by a 
bunch of cute shrine maidens,

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.760
and there aren't any ghosts around.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.330
Ghosts?

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:38.520
Oh, just talking to myself.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.390
So who is he?

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:42.680
Beats me.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:45.510
So he's a friend of yours?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.180
Please make yourself at 
home while you wait.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.600
Yes!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.180
I'm exhausted!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.600
You should be ashamed of yourself.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.810
You're too hard on us!

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:13.660
Help yourself to the onigiri.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:14.500
Okay.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.650
Let's eat!

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.380
My grandmother was British.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.130
He's fitting right in.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.530
Y-Yeah...

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.800
Oh, take your time eating lunch.

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:31.460
Yes.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.770
Oh, where's Takami-san?

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.440
Not sure where he went.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.260
Makoto-oneechan!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.570
Oh, Aki-chan, Sa-chan!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.440
This is Taiga-kun from our class.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:47.710
He sits next to me.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:48.880
He's in my group!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.370
Hello.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.370
Wow, cute boy!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.290
<i>Is he really a boy?</i>

00:05:56.630 --> 00:06:00.250
Hey, Taiga. Why are you 
hanging out with girls?

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:01.860
Hey, Yuuya!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.210
You shut up!

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:06.210
Taiga, are you sure you're not a girl?

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.010
Taiga-kun is sweet, unlike you!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.360
Shut up, ugly!

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.680
Hey, Yuuya!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.180
Uh-oh, it's Grandma!

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:13.580
Crap!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.350
Run!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.390
We were like them once.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.070
Mako-chi!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.970
Thank goodness...

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:24.110
We finally made it!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.990
Kozue-chan, Saki-chan.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.370
You made it!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.560
We got lost...

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:31.900
She was walking the opposite direction.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:34.120
There's still plenty of 
time left, so it's okay.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.460
Look! Shrine maiden outfits!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:38.870
Nice! you all look really cute.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.750
Is that your dad?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.200
Yep, that's him.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.660
Oh, he looks like a nice guy.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.460
It's a real priest!

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.050
It's not a big deal.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.010
It's my first time. Tell me what to do.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:51.420
Sure.

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:54.510
Here, you need to write your 
name and age on this katashiro.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:59.300
Then you blow your breath on it three 
times to transfer any impurities.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.730
You can also rub it against any part 
of your body that doesn't feel right.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:04.840
I know how it works!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:06.650
My family does this every year.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:09.370
Oh, they come in car shapes, too.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:13.760
So there's this fee involved 
when a cleansing is performed.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.550
Oh, it's okay.

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:20.290
Thank you.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.000
Oh, it's the prince.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.590
You scared me.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.460
You just noticed?

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.580
Sorry, I'll be right back.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.470
Okay.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.630
Hiwako-sama!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.230
Yoshizumi-san, you made it.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.890
Yes...

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.400
<i>Wait, this is not good...</i>

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:49.120
Hiwako, need any help?

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.130
We're good!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.530
Senpai, you weren't 
joking about coming...

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.490
Wow, you're dressed all in white.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.760
It's a different look.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.080
He forced me to come!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.000
Come on. You should be happy 
that you get to skip practice.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:03.880
Anyway, here you go.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.880
I told all of the members to write one.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.420
I'm impressed that you 
actually pulled it off.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.870
They were all glad to participate.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.640
Did we have a choice?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.270
And for the fee...

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.270
What fee?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:22.060
No fee, huh...

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.380
Wait, hold on!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.470
We want to follow the 
correct procedure.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.820
Is 1,000 yen enough?

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.720
Kosugi, chip in.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:35.700
Uh, I only have enough 
for the bus ride home!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.370
Is 50 yen enough?

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:41.620
I can probably contribute another 5,000 yen.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.220
Seriously?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.080
Wait, why do you have that much money?!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.490
Sorry.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:48.020
Well, they'll be grouped together.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.980
It's the thought that counts.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.550
I promise to physically return the favor!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:54.090
In that case...

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:57.330
Hiwako, why don't you join me for 
dinner when you're finished?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:57.970
No, thank you.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.760
When you leave, take him with you.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:02.390
Oh, he's also here?

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.080
Um, are you Kinu-chan-senpai?

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:10.710
I wanted to thank you 
for the delicious tofu.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:14.610
Oh, it's okay. It wasn't a big deal.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.540
Hey, Saeki!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.330
Yes!

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.790
I need to get going.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:25.410
Yep.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:27.040
I'll be right back.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.250
Dude, that girl's so cute!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.260
Is she an angel?!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.170
What?!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.320
Oh, so the turnout's pretty good.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.560
Not too bad, I guess.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.980
Well, our shrine had lots more people!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.100
Is Satoru okay?

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.560
He looks like he's doing fine.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.810
Come on, we have a job to do.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.520
I know that!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.140
You don't have to pick me up!

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:10.750
Uncle!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.380
Grandma and Grandpa!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:13.760
Thanks for coming!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:17.090
Oh, what a lovely little shrine maiden.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.150
Please make yourself comfortable.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.820
You're late. We've 
been waiting for you.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.970
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:28.890
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:28.880
And its so good!

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.540
How's business?

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:31.940
Uncle Yoshitomo!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.450
You look sharp!

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:35.200
Like a completely different 
person from this morning!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.470
Where'd you go?

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.530
Well...

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.520
And is it almost time?!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.710
Wait, Dad hasn't gotten changed yet?!

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:48.510
It'll be fine! Don't 
trip over yourself!

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:48.510
Come on, Dad!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.000
But she looks just like Yuu-chan now...

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.530
Saeki's mom?

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:02.930
Yes, but Yuu-chan's hair 
was longer and black.

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:06.390
Are you married, Takami-san?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:11.770
Nope. Sadly, I'm still looking 
for a wife at this age.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.950
But I'd expect women 
to be all over you.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.860
Are priests not very popular?

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:19.590
No, I was very popular.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:21.110
So what's the problem?

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:26.920
Priests appear to be special.

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:31.520
They're popular, but people 
tend to keep their distance.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:34.960
We're the same as 
everyone else, though.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.750
Oh...

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:42.880
However, people still admire priests, 
and that admiration is important,

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.720
but they don't take it any farther.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.850
That's probably why you 
quit being a priest!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.730
Some woman told you that you 
didn't look like a priest!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:56.690
Well, that might be it, to be honest...

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.120
You hear that?

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:01.380
If you keep chasing after 
him, you'll get burned.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.620
I'm not...

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:03.740
Yo!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.200
Hey, Shohei!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.280
You're late!

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:15.860
Takami-kun, stop fooling 
around and go get changed.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:17.040
Yes, yes...

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.560
Stop teasing those girls.

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:23.370
Oh, you were watching?

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:27.720
I wish I had a teenage 
girl chasing after me.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.700
Honestly, you never grow up...

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:32.380
You need to get married!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.690
I was married once, but...

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.540
There are a lot of people today.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.460
I'm getting nervous.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:48.350
Honestly, pull yourself together.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:49.370
There, you look okay.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.460
Get going.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:57.520
Dad!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.710
You look cool!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.290
Thank you, Makoto.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.570
We will now perform the 
Summer Cleansing Ceremony.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.560
Come on! Over here, guys!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.330
Huh? We can join in?

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:26.030
Yes, we can do this together.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:37.800
Those who participate 
in the June Summer Cleansing

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:46.970
have a thousand years added to their life.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:54.970
Those who participate in the 
June Summer Cleansing...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.000
Oh, if you're underage, 
you only get to take a sip.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.880
Hiwako, are you busy 
after this is over?

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:07.840
You take the thatch and keep 
wrapping it around to form a ring,

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.010
then you hang it on your door 
and pray for good health.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.610
Hiwako! Hiwako!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:15.960
We're leaving!

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:17.700
See you on Monday!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.770
Bye-bye!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.160
Bye-bye!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:23.980
I'll be back later to pick you up.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.070
Yes.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.290
Funabashi-san, you don't look too good.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.340
Are you tired?

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.950
I feel fine.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.870
Saeki, is there something left?

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.020
There's the banquet.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:40.230
Everyone shares the offerings 
that were made to the gods.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.580
It's basically a feast.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.380
Sounds great!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.790
But first, we need to cast the 
katashiro into the river.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:48.300
Wanna come?

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:51.020
That sounds fun! Let's go, Funabashi!

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.000
Yes!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.090
What do I do?

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.510
Why don't you leave?

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.930
Feels so good!

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.100
Satoru-kun.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:26.540
Huh? Saeki?

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.760
I like to watch from above.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:36.460
Gin.

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:37.340
Yo.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.110
Satoru!

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.360
How did it go for you?

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.390
What do you mean?

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:48.400
Well, aren't you always inside 
the shrine during festivals?

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:51.390
Are you talking to the gods?

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:53.150
Yeah, something like that.

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:56.640
Oh, I don't think I've ever asked.

00:16:56.640 --> 00:17:00.580
What is Uka-no-Mitama like?

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:04.040
So, the way it works is

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:07.110
the gods never stay in one place

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:09.320
and leave as soon as the festival ends.

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:14.220
That's what we were taught.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.180
Yeah.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:19.360
It doesn't matter if the 
gods are around or not.

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:22.750
In your world, it only matters 
if you believe in them or not.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.190
It's all about possibility.

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:27.010
They're there if you believe in them.

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.440
Shouldn't that be good enough?

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:31.840
But since you can see heralds,

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:35.800
you're more likely to 
believe in the gods.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:36.680
Oh.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:37.660
That's right.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.530
But it's funny...

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:44.300
Festivals have been happening 
for a long time,

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:46.550
bringing people together,

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.720
and you've been there to watch over us.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:52.850
You'll continue to be there,

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.270
so we're all tied together.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:01.280
Those who participate in 
the June Summer Cleansing

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:04.620
have a thousand years 
added to their life.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:10.670
If I could live to be a thousand, 
I'd get to be with you forever.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.070
Don't be crazy.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.800
You'll be all withered up before then.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.120
Well, I'll be with you 'til the end.

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:27.510
Jeez, don't treat me like a kid!

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:31.120
As far as I'm concerned, 
Tatsuo and Yoshitomo are also kids.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:36.090
Right... It's my turn now...

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.630
Hey, Gintaro.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:44.530
When I grow up, 
I'm going to be Dad's bride.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:46.180
That's nice.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:48.890
Don't be jealous.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.150
It's the only way.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:53.070
You're a fox spirit, 
so I can't marry you.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:58.990
Dad is the chief priest here, 
so he'll always be around.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:02.430
So I'll just marry Dad instead.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.920
Yeah, yeah. Whatever you want.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:12.760
Then I get to be with you forever.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:18.920
How could I forget?

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:20.180
Gin!

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.390
What is it?

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.850
I want to protect the place that serves

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:28.810
as a link and brings everyone together.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.150
So, Gin!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:36.130
Promise! You have to stick with me!

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.930
Wh-What's this about?

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:40.110
What? This is a pinky swear.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:43.120
I already made a promise.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.070
Jeez... Come on!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.650
It won't work! Your hand's too big!

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:54.250
And which one's your pinky?

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.500
Stop complaining.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.410
Come on, Gin.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.860
Everybody's here for 
the Summer Cleansing.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:04.720
You should greet your friends.

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:07.930
What? I don't have any friends.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:10.030
Huh? What are you are talking about?

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:14.540
Humans and gods get together 
a few times every year,

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.400
so heralds should do the same.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.210
There's Saimaru-san, 
Utamaru-san, and the turtle.

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.710
There's also Fuu-chan and Fuku-chan.

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:23.820
Sounds like a pain.

00:20:24.270 --> 00:20:28.830
Jeez. Kinjiro probably left because 
you were always like this!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.510
R-Really?

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:32.620
Come on!

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:35.110
Fine, fine. I'll go!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.660
Wait, why do I have to come?!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.670
See you later.

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:45.170
There they go.

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:45.710
Yeah.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.510
Saeki! Can you see what 
they're doing from here?

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:57.580
Yep.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.570
Look how far they're going!

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.370
Good thing the weather's nice.

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:33.620
Yep, summer's here.

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:35.590
Yeah.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:43.080
My home is a small Inari shrine

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:45.300
that's been around since the Edo period.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:50.290
Our shrine is dedicated to the god 
of agriculture, Uka-no-Mitama.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:56.040
<b>Cream Bun</b>

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:56.040
<b>Tangerine 
Gelatin</b>

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:07.710
If you happen to be in the area, 
please stop by Saeki Shrine.

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.800
You might run into my 
father, the relaxed priest

00:22:11.170 --> 00:22:15.690
or a small and energetic fox spirit

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:20.900
and a large, very lazy 
and gruff fox spirit.

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:31.220
All of us will be here waiting for you.
